B.LM=new A.N2(null)
B.Mp=new A.c9("'Twas the night before Christmas, when all through the house\nNot a creature was stirring, not even a mouse;\nThe stockings were hung by the chimney with care,\nIn hopes that St. Nicholas soon would be there;","nbc_house_night",null,B.Z)
B.M6=new A.c9("The children were nestled all snug in their beds;\nWhile visions of sugar-plums danced in their heads;\nAnd mamma in her 'kerchief, and I in my cap,\nHad just settled our brains for a long winter's nap,","nbc_bedroom",null,B.Z)
B.Mw=new A.c9("When out on the lawn there arose such a clatter,\nI sprang from the bed to see what was the matter.\nAway to the window I flew like a flash,\nTore open the shutters and threw up the sash.","nbc_house_night",null,B.Z)
B.M9=new A.c9("The moon on the breast of the new-fallen snow,\nGave the lustre of mid-day to objects below,\nWhen, what to my wondering eyes did appear,\nBut a miniature sleigh, and eight tiny reindeer,","nbc_sleigh_sky",null,B.Z)
B.MD=new A.c9("With a little old driver, so lively and quick,\nI knew in a moment it must be St. Nick.\nMore rapid than eagles his coursers they came,\nAnd he whistled, and shouted, and called them by name;","nbc_sleigh_sky","char_santa",B.Z)
B.Mz=new A.c9('"Now, Dasher! now, Dancer! now, Prancer and Vixen!\nOn, Comet! on, Cupid! on, Donner and Blitzen!\nTo the top of the porch! to the top of the wall!\nNow dash away! dash away! dash away all!"',"nbc_sleigh_sky","char_reindeer",B.Z)
B.My=new A.c9("As dry leaves that before the wild hurricane fly,\nWhen they meet with an obstacle, mount to the sky;\nSo up to the house-top the coursers they flew,\nWith the sleigh full of toys, and St. Nicholas too.","nbc_roof_sleigh",null,B.Z)
B.Ms=new A.c9("And then, in a twinkling, I heard on the roof\nThe prancing and pawing of each little hoof.\nAs I drew in my head, and was turning around,\nDown the chimney St. Nicholas came with a bound.","nbc_rooftop",null,B.Z)
B.Mk=new A.c9("He was dressed all in fur, from his head to his foot,\nAnd his clothes were all tarnished with ashes and soot;\nA bundle of toys he had flung on his back,\nAnd he looked like a peddler just opening his pack.","nbc_fireplace","char_santa",B.Z)
B.MA=new A.c9("His eyes\u2014how they twinkled! his dimples how merry!\nHis cheeks were like roses, his nose like a cherry!\nHis droll little mouth was drawn up like a bow,\nAnd the beard of his chin was as white as the snow;","nbc_fireplace","char_santa",B.Z)
B.Mi=new A.c9("The stump of a pipe he held tight in his teeth,\nAnd the smoke it encircled his head like a wreath;\nHe had a broad face and a little round belly,\nThat shook, when he laughed like a bowlful of jelly.","nbc_fireplace","char_santa",B.Z)
B.MC=new A.c9("He was chubby and plump, a right jolly old elf,\nAnd I laughed when I saw him, in spite of myself;\nA wink of his eye and a twist of his head,\nSoon gave me to know I had nothing to dread;","nbc_fireplace","char_santa",B.Z)
B.Mo=new A.c9("He spoke not a word, but went straight to his work,\nAnd filled all the stockings; then turned with a jerk,\nAnd laying his finger aside of his nose,\nAnd giving a nod, up the chimney he rose;","nbc_fireplace","char_santa",B.Z)
B.Mg=new A.c9('He sprang to his sleigh, to his team gave a whistle,\nAnd away they all flew like the down of a thistle.\nBut I heard him exclaim, ere he drove out of sight,\n"Happy Christmas to all, and to all a good-night."',"nbc_sleigh_sky",null,B.Z)
B.Qj=s([B.Mp,B.M6,B.Mw,B.M9,B.MD,B.Mz,B.My,B.Ms,B.Mk,B.MA,B.Mi,B.MC,B.Mo,B.Mg],t.jJ)
B.ME=new A.q6("night-before-christmas","The Night Before Christmas","nbc_house_night",B.Qj,"What do you think the children dreamed about that night?")
B.Mt=new A.c9("It was Christmas Eve. Clara and her family were having a party in their parlor, with a big glowing tree.","nut_parlor","char_clara",B.Z)
B.iL=s(["char_clara","char_nutcracker"],t.s)
B.Mh=new A.c9("Her godfather gave her a gift: a wooden Nutcracker doll with a bright red coat and a big smile. Clara loved him right away.","nut_parlor",null,B.iL)
B.Me=new A.c9("That night, Clara tiptoed down to see her Nutcracker one more time. The clock struck twelve, and the tree began to grow and grow!","nut_parlor","char_clara",B.Z)
B.R6=s(["char_toy_soldier","char_nutcracker","char_mouse","char_mouse_king"],t.s)
B.Ml=new A.c9("Out came the Mouse King and his mice. The toys woke up too! The Nutcracker led the toy soldiers into a make-believe battle.","nut_battle",null,B.R6)
B.Rv=s(["char_clara","char_nutcracker","char_mouse_king"],t.s)
B.Mj=new A.c9("Clara bravely tossed her slipper, and the Mouse King tumbled over. The mice ran away. The Nutcracker turned into a handsome prince.","nut_battle",null,B.Rv)
B.M8=new A.c9('"Thank you, Clara," said the Prince. "Come with me!" They walked through a sparkling, snowy forest while snowflakes danced around them.',"nut_snow_forest",null,B.iL)
B.Mq=new A.c9("At the end of the forest was the Land of Sweets. The Sugar Plum Fairy welcomed them, and candy dancers twirled just for Clara.","nut_sweets_land",null,B.iL)
B.Mv=new A.c9("Then Clara felt sleepy. When she opened her eyes, she was home by the Christmas tree, hugging her Nutcracker. Was it a dream? Maybe!","nut_parlor",null,B.iL)
B.RK=s([B.Mt,B.Mh,B.Me,B.Ml,B.Mj,B.M8,B.Mq,B.Mv],t.jJ)
B.MF=new A.q6("nutcracker","The Nutcracker","char_nutcracker",B.RK,"Clara was kind to her Nutcracker. How can you be kind to a toy or a friend?")
B.Mc=new A.c9("People all over the world celebrate Christmas, and every place has its own special traditions. Let us visit four countries!","world_map",null,B.Z)
B.Ma=new A.c9("In Mexico, families celebrate Las Posadas. For nine nights before Christmas, friends walk together in a procession, singing songs, and then have a party.","world_mexico",null,B.Z)
B.M7=new A.c9("At Mexican parties, children swing at a pi\xf1ata filled with treats. Red and green poinsettia flowers, which grow wild in Mexico, decorate many homes.","world_mexico",null,B.Z)
B.Mb=new A.c9("In Sweden, Saint Lucia Day is on December 13. A girl wears a white gown and a crown of candles, and the family eats sweet saffron buns.","world_sweden",null,B.Z)
B.MB=new A.c9("In Germany, towns hold Christmas markets with lights, music, sweets and gifts. Many families have Christmas trees and Advent calendars that count down the days.","world_germany",null,B.Z)
B.Mx=new A.c9("In the Philippines, people hang a parol, a star-shaped lantern, in their windows. Parols are made with bamboo and bright paper, and they glow at night.","world_philippines",null,B.Z)
B.Se=s([B.Mc,B.Ma,B.M7,B.Mb,B.MB,B.Mx],t.jJ)
B.MH=new A.q6("christmas-around-the-world","Christmas Around the World","world_map",B.Se,"Which tradition would you most like to try? What does your family do?")
B.Mf=new A.c9("It was the busiest day at the North Pole workshop. Pip the elf was in charge of the gift tags, and he was very proud of the job.","story_workshop","char_elf",B.Z)
B.Mu=new A.c9("Oh no! Pip put the tags on the wrong boxes. The bike had a tag for a teddy bear, and the drum had a tag for a puzzle!","story_workshop","char_elf",B.Z)
B.Mm=new A.c9('Pip felt terrible. "I made a big mix-up, and the sleigh leaves tonight," he told Santa. His ears drooped.',"story_workshop","char_elf",B.Z)
B.Mr=new A.c9('"Everyone makes mistakes," said Santa with a smile. "Let us fix it together. Ask your friends for help." Pip rang the workshop bell.',"story_workshop","char_santa",B.Z)
B.Mn=new A.c9("Elves came running from every corner. One read the names, one checked the lists, and one peeled off old tags. Pip stuck on the right ones.","story_workshop","char_elf",B.Z)
B.Md=new A.c9("Just in time, every gift had the right tag. The sleigh flew over the snowy village, and Pip learned that a mistake is easy to fix with friends.","story_village","char_elf",B.Z)
B.Rt=s([B.Mf,B.Mu,B.Mm,B.Mr,B.Mn,B.Md],t.jJ)
B.MG=new A.q6("trouble-at-the-workshop","Trouble at the Workshop","story_workshop",B.Rt,"Who helped fix the problem? When did you last solve one with a team?")
